A||||15||mrfixit58||I'M PUBLISHED IN FOCOA!!!||||6||
Z||000000||mrfixit58||12-13-2001||03:21 PM||||I went to our club meeting last night and one of our members had the latest copy of the FOCOA magazine. Inside, there is an article about our club and, much to my surprise, a copy of an article I wrote for our news letter. They spelled my last name incorrectly and made a few typos in the re-copy but still.. I'M PUBLISHED NATIONALLY! Next stop, the Pulitzer Prize...  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Anyway, just thought I'd rave,<P>------------------<BR>Roy  :D <BR>Just another stock Blue 87 GT   <BR>Suncoast Fieros<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pennocksize.JPG">          <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <P><B>JUST ADDED: </B>1988 GT w/ T-Tops, 5-Speed, and Performance Sound.||||reg||6
Z||000001||MinnGreenGT||12-13-2001||03:25 PM||||What was the article about...?  Hey- why not just post it here for the rest of us to read  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  (Those of us who are either not FOCOA members, or those of use who are- and just aren't recieving the magazine...)||||reg||1
